    "This manifest is a source-of-truth allowlist only. It does not grant, prove, or perform any deployment.",
    "Production's functionsAllowlist is the 8 dashboard write/Gantt Callables (the eight-function deployment contract, PROD PR #11), the shared presence scheduler, and the Admin permission callable setUserPermissionOverrides (moved from the pending gate by the User Permissions V2 promotion). Being allowlisted does NOT authorize deploying every managed Function: each release names its reviewed subset under `releases`.",
    "Production's functionsPreserveExisting explicitly permits the eight existing Executive Functions to remain live, but does not authorize deploying, updating, or deleting them as part of Core Production. Executive has a separate future release/security gate.",
